# a short staged performance about fantics itself, using the technique
# to explain the technique

TYPE 60
The computer is not a mere calculating engine.
END

PAUSE 900
END

TYPE 40
It is a new medium -
END

FLASH 1400
a medium for THOUGHT itself.
END

PAUSE 700
END

TYPE 35
Nelson called the craft of staging that medium "fantics":
how information is paced, emphasized, and withheld -
END

PAUSE 500
END

FLASH 1600
not just what is shown, but WHEN.
END

PAUSE 900
END

TYPE 50
This pause, for instance, meant something.
END
